sequenceDiagram
    participant HostApp as Consuming Laravel App
    participant RM as Revision Manager
    participant MR as Model Registry
    participant ES as Event Store

    HostApp->>RM: rollback(entity, targetRevision)
    RM->>MR: resolve targetRevision definition
    MR-->>RM: prior model definition
    RM->>ES: read event log for entity
    ES-->>RM: event history
    RM->>RM: recompute state against prior revision
    RM->>ES: append RolledBackEvent
    RM-->>HostApp: restored state
